     "e341c87d-07b5-4162-8872-65fe97f4dfdd": {
      "comment": {},
      "data": {
       "cells": {
        "9e6tmT": {
         "data": "Eisenhower Matrix on Eisenhower Matrix Task Board _ Trello.pdf",
         "field_type": 0
        },
        "edmELG": {
         "data": "Eisenhower Matrix",
         "field_type": 0
        },
        "i1eC3u": {
         "created_at": 1786516328,
         "data": "The lists represents the category the task belong too.The cards represents the tasks.Categories describing the type of tasks:I Important & urgent:- Crises- Pressing problems- Deadline-driven projects, meetings, reparationsII Important but less urgent:- Preperation- Prevention- Values clarification- Planning- Relationship building- True re-creation- EmpowermentIII Urgent but less important:- Interruptions, some phone calls- Some mail, some reports- Some meetings- Many proximate, pressing matters- Many popular activitiesIV Not important & not urgent:- Trivia, busywork- Some phone calls- Time wasters- \"Escape\" activities- Irrelevant mail- Excessive TV",
         "field_type": 0,
         "last_modified": 1786516328
        },
        "sFXP7E": {
         "data": "eOZU",
         "field_type": 3
        },
        "ututMu": {
         "data": "[ ] Deside if the task is urgent and how important it is. (in witch list does it belong?)\n[ ] Make a card with task-name in the correct list.\n[ ] Put every information (/attachment), that you need to fulfil the task, within the card.\n[ ] Optional: You could choose to put a due date for the task.\n[ ] Optional: If it is a big task you could choose to split it up in mini tasks by using a checklist like this.\n[ ] Optional: If you choose to delegate a task you could invite the person you like to delegate the task too to be a member to a specific task (card). You could chat within the card with each-other to discus the task.\n[ ] When a task is complete, just simply click on the card and move it to the list 'Done\"",
         "field_type": 0
        }
       },
       "created_at": 1786516127,
