       "field_type": 3
      },
      "ututMu": {
       "data": "[ ] Deside if the task is urgent and how important it is. (in witch list does it belong?)\n[ ] Make a card with task-name in the correct list.\n[ ] Put every information (/attachment), that you need to fulfil the task, within the card.\n[ ] Optional: You could choose to put a due date for the task.\n[ ] Optional: If it is a big task you could choose to split it up in mini tasks by using a checklist like this.\n[ ] Optional: If you choose to delegate a task you could invite the person you like to delegate the task too to be a member to a specific task (card). You could chat within the card with each-other to discus the task.\n[ ] When a task is complete, just simply click on the card and move it to the list 'Done\"",
       "field_type": 0
      }
